      ],
      "source": "https://colorado.wiki/a/Nunn,_Colorado",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Recent decades have seen Nunn grow as a rural retreat for commuters working in Fort Collins and other nearby cities.",
